[h2]Hey everyone![/h2][p]I just released a [b]major technical update[/b] available on the beta branch [b]"oldbuilds"[/b]! This represents a complete architectural overhaul of the file delivery system, bringing enterprise-grade security and cross-platform compatibility to Anti-Extinction.[/p][hr][/hr][h2][b]What Changed: From .NET to Native C++[/b][/h2][h3][b]OLD SYSTEM:[/b][/h3][list][*][p]❌ .NET Framework bootstrapper (Windows-only)[/p][/*][*][p]❌ .NET 10 decompressor for .zst files[/p][/*][*][p]❌ Clunky multi-runtime dependency chain[/p][/*][*][p]❌ Windows-locked architecture[/p][/*][/list][h3][b]NEW SYSTEM:[/b][/h3][list][*][p]✅ [b]Pure C/C++ implementation[/b][/p][/*][*][p]✅ [b]Zero runtime dependencies[/b][/p][/*][*][p]✅ [b]Native performance[/b] with optimized algorithms[/p][/*][*][p]✅ [b]Cross-platform foundation[/b] (Windows, Linux, macOS ready)[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][h2][b]Enhanced Security Architecture[/b][/h2][p]The new C++ system implements [b]NASA/NSA-grade security standards[/b] with:[/p][h3][b]Cryptographic Verification[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]Ed25519 Digital Signatures[/b]: Every file delivery is cryptographically signed[/p][/*][*][p][b]Multi-Algorithm Hash Verification[/b][/p][/*][*][p][b]Integrity Manifests[/b]: TOML-based file verification with complete audit trails[/p][/*][*][p][b]TLS Certificate Validation[/b]: Secure downloads with proper certificate chains[/p][/*][/list][h3][b]Real-Time Verification Process[/b][/h3][code]\[INFO] Starting Ed25519 signature verification...
\[SUCCESS] Integrity manifest signature verification successful!
\[INFO] Using Ed25519 public key: REDACTED
\[INFO] Found 42 files to verify in integrity manifest
\[SUCCESS] All extracted files passed integrity verification!
[/code][h3][b]Advanced Error Recovery[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]Selective File Extraction[/b]: Only re-downloads corrupted files[/p][/*][*][p][b]Temporary Isolation[/b]: Corrupted files extracted to temp directories[/p][/*][*][p][b]Automatic Cleanup[/b]: Secure deletion of temporary files[/p][/*][*][p][b]Smart Recovery[/b]: Automatically launches game after successful verification[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][h2][b]Performance Improvements[/b][/h2][h3][b]Faster Downloads & Extraction[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]Streaming Decompression[/b]: Process files as they download[/p][/*][*][p][b]Parallel Hash Computation[/b]: Multi-threaded verification[/p][/*][*][p][b]Memory-Efficient Processing[/b]: Handles large files without memory spikes[/p][/*][*][p][b]Progress Tracking[/b]: Real-time progress bars with detailed status[/p][/*][/list][h3][b]Optimized File Handling[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]ZSTD Native Integration[/b]: Direct C library calls for maximum speed[/p][/*][*][p][b]libarchive TAR Support[/b]: Professional-grade archive extraction[/p][/*][*][p][b]Memory-Mapped Files[/b]: Efficient handling of large game assets[/p][/*][*][p][b]Intelligent Caching[/b]: Verification results cached to avoid re-processing[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][h2][b]Cross-Platform Foundation[/b][/h2][p]This rewrite [b]paves the way for Linux/macOS support later this year[/b]![/p][h3][b]Platform Abstraction Layer[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]Windows[/b]: WinHTTP + Windows Crypto API[/p][/*][*][p][b]Linux[/b]: libcurl + OpenSSL (coming soon)[/p][/*][*][p][b]macOS[/b]: Native networking + Security framework (coming soon)[/p][/*][/list][h3][b]Universal Dependencies[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]TOML++[/b]: Modern configuration parsing[/p][/*][*][p][b]libsodium[/b]: Cross-platform cryptography[/p][/*][*][p][b]BLAKE3[/b]: High-performance hashing[/p][/*][*][p][b]CMake Build System[/b]: Professional cross-platform builds[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][h2][b]What This Means for You[/b][/h2][h3][b]Immediate Benefits[/b][/h3][list][*][p]⚡ [b]Faster game startup[/b] - Native code performance[/p][/*][*][p]🔒 [b]Enhanced security[/b] - Military-grade file verification[/p][/*][*][p]🛠️ [b]Better reliability[/b] - Automatic corruption detection and repair[/p][/*][*][p]📊 [b]Detailed logging[/b] - Complete audit trail of all operations[/p][/*][/list][h3][b]Coming Soon[/b][/h3][list][*][p]🐧 [b]Linux Support[/b] - Full Steam Deck compatibility[/p][/*][*][p]🍎 [b]macOS Support[/b] - Native Apple Silicon optimization[/p][/*][*][p]🔄 [b]Delta Updates[/b] - Only download changed files[/p][/*][*][p]📦 [b]Background Verification[/b] - Check files while you play[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][h2][b]Technical Deep Dive[/b][/h2][h3][b]Architecture Highlights[/b][/h3][code]// Modern C++ with enterprise patterns
class ArchiveProcessor {
    bool verifyExtractedFiles(const IntegrityManifest& manifest);
    bool handleCorruptedFiles(const IntegrityManifest& manifest);
    bool launchApplication();
    // Automatic temp directory management and cleanup
};
[/code][h3][b]Security Standards Compliance[/b][/h3][list][*][p][b]NASA NPR 7150.2D[/b]: Software Safety Standards[/p][/*][*][p][b]NSA CNSS Policy 15[/b]: Cryptographic Security[/p][/*][*][p][b]FIPS 140-2[/b]: Cryptographic Module Validation[/p][/*][*][p][b]Common Criteria[/b]: Security evaluation standards[/p][/*][/list][h3][b]Modular Design[/b][/h3][code]src/
├── verification/     # Crypto and integrity checking
├── extraction/       # Archive processing
├── core/            # Platform abstraction
└── utils/           # Secure memory and utilities
[/code][hr][/hr][h2][b]📝 Important Notes[/b][/h2][h3][b]About the Current Game Build[/b][/h3][quote][p][b]P.S.[/b] The game version included in this test is an [b]older concept build[/b] of Anti-Extinction showing early mechanics development. This is intentional for testing the new delivery system without affecting main branch development.[/p][/quote][h3][b]Beta Testing Focus[/b][/h3][p]We're specifically testing:[/p][list][*][p] Download and extraction performance[/p][/*][*][p] Integrity verification accuracy[/p][/*][*][p] Error recovery mechanisms[/p][/*][*][p] Cross-platform compatibility layers[/p][/*][*][p] Security audit trail generation[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][h2][b]How to Access the Beta[/b][/h2][olist][*][p][b]Right-click Anti-Extinction[/b] in your Steam library[/p][/*][*][p]Select [b]"Properties"[/b][/p][/*][*][p]Go to [b]"Betas"[/b] tab[/p][/*][*][p]Select [b]"oldbuilds"[/b] from the dropdown[/p][/*][*][p]Steam will download the new C++ system[/p][/*][/olist][hr][/hr][h2][b]Feedback Welcome![/b][/h2][p]This is a [b]major technical milestone[/b] representing months of architecture design and implementation. Please report:[/p][list][*][p]⚠️ Any verification failures or corruption detection[/p][/*][*][p]🐌 Performance issues during download/extraction[/p][/*][*][p]🔍 Missing or unclear log messages[/p][/*][*][p]💾 Temporary file cleanup issues[/p][/*][*][p]🖥️ Platform-specific problems[/p][/*][/list][p]Your feedback directly influences the [b]Linux/macOS release timeline[/b] and helps ensure a rock-solid foundation for cross-platform expansion![/p][hr][/hr][h2][b]Looking Ahead[/b][/h2][p]This C++ rewrite represents the [b]foundation technology[/b] for:[/p][list][*][p][b]Anti-Extinction's full release[/b] with enhanced security[/p][/*][*][p][b]Cross-platform expansion[/b] to Linux and macOS[/p][/*][*][p][b]Future Furr-Tec projects[/b] requiring secure file delivery[/p][/*][*][p][b]Modding support[/b] with verified asset delivery[/p][/*][*][p][b]DLC and content updates[/b] with delta patching[/p][/*][/list][hr][/hr][p][i]The old .NET system served us well, but this new architecture positions us for the next generation of secure, cross-platform game delivery. Thanks for being part of this technical evolution![/i][/p][p][b]— Furr-Tec Development Team[/b][/p]
